  "prompt_hash": "sha256 of the step's prompt file's bytes, a newline, and its user text: rule steps 'Rule <id>: <text>\\n\\nDraft:\\n<draft>' with prompt-v1.txt; the claims step 'Draft:\\n<draft>' with claims-prompt-v1.txt; the verdict step 'Verdict: <verdict>\\n\\nRule results:\\n<canonical results>' with verdict-prompt-v1.txt",
